A tab inside a line is content in a label and after a definition marker

```
see [t][a	b]

[a b]: /u
.
<p>see [t][a	b]</p>
```

```
see [t][ab]

[a b]: /u
.
<p>see [t][ab]</p>
```

```
see [t][ a  b ]

[a b]: /u
.
<p>see <a href="/u">t</a></p>
```

```
see [^a	b]

[^a b]: note
.
<p>see [^a	b]</p>
```

```
see [t][a]

[a]: 	/u
.
<p>see [t][a]</p>
<p>[a]: 	/u</p>
```

```
see [t][a]

[a]:  /u
.
<p>see <a href="/u">t</a></p>
```
